---
import MainGridLayout from "@/layouts/MainGridLayout.astro";

interface Props {
	lang?: string;
}

const { lang = Astro.url.pathname.startsWith("/en") ? "en" : "zh_CN" } =
	Astro.props;
const isEn = lang === "en";

const title = isEn
	? "ONE BLACK CELL · Elementary Cellular Automata Playground"
	: "一个黑点，炸开混沌 · ONE BLACK CELL";
const description = isEn
	? "From a single black cell and an 8-bit lookup table, explore all 256 elementary cellular automata: Rule 30's deterministic chaos, Rule 90's Sierpinski fractal, Rule 110's universal computation, and Rule 184's traffic jams."
	: "一个居中黑点，配合 8 位规则表，在确定性世界里炸开整个混沌宇宙。探索全部 256 种初等元胞自动机：30 号混沌、90 号分形、110 号图灵完备宇宙与 184 号交通流。";
---

<MainGridLayout title={title} description={description} lang={lang}>
	<div class="flex w-full rounded-(--radius-large) overflow-hidden relative min-h-32 mb-8">
		<div class="z-10 px-4 sm:px-8 py-8 relative w-full rounded-(--radius-large) overflow-hidden bg-[#050814] text-slate-100 border border-slate-800/80 shadow-2xl selection:bg-amber-500/30 selection:text-amber-200">
			<!-- Ambient Mathematical Grid & Energy Glows -->
			<div class="absolute inset-0 pointer-events-none opacity-20 bg-[radial-gradient(#f59e0b_1px,transparent_1px)] [background-size:24px_24px] overflow-hidden"></div>
			<div class="absolute -top-36 -left-36 w-96 h-96 bg-amber-600/15 rounded-full blur-3xl pointer-events-none"></div>
			<div class="absolute top-1/3 -right-32 w-96 h-96 bg-cyan-600/15 rounded-full blur-3xl pointer-events-none"></div>
			<div class="absolute bottom-16 left-1/4 w-96 h-96 bg-rose-600/10 rounded-full blur-3xl pointer-events-none"></div>

			<!-- HERO HEADER SECTION -->
			<header class="relative z-10 mb-10 pb-8 border-b border-slate-800/80">
				<div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3 mb-4">
					<div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2">
						<div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-amber-500/10 border border-amber-500/30 text-amber-300 text-xs font-mono font-semibold tracking-wide">
							<span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-amber-400 animate-pulse"></span>
							<span>HN TODAY (2026-10-23) · RULE 30: ONE BLACK CELL</span>
						</div>
						<div class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-cyan-500/10 border border-cyan-500/30 text-cyan-300 text-xs font-mono">
							<span>⚛️</span>
							<span class="lang-zh">初等元胞自动机 · 256 种离散宇宙</span>
							<span class="lang-en">Elementary CA · 256 Discrete Universes</span>
						</div>
						<div class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-purple-500/10 border border-purple-500/30 text-purple-300 text-xs font-mono">
							<span>⚡</span>
							<span class="lang-zh">计算不可约性 · 图灵完备</span>
							<span class="lang-en">Computational Irreducibility · Universal</span>
						</div>
					</div>

					<!-- In-Page Language Switcher -->
					<div class="flex items-center gap-3">
						<div class="text-xs font-mono text-slate-400 hidden sm:block">
							<span class="lang-zh">离散动力系统沙盒 · 2026-10-23</span>
							<span class="lang-en">Discrete Dynamical Playground · 2026-10-23</span>
						</div>
						<a
							id="inpage-lang-toggle"
							href={isEn ? "/projects/one-black-cell/" : "/en/projects/one-black-cell/"}
							class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1 rounded-lg bg-slate-900 border border-amber-500/40 text-amber-300 hover:text-white hover:bg-amber-950/60 font-mono text-xs transition cursor-pointer active:scale-95"
							title={isEn ? "切换为中文" : "Switch to English"}
						>
							<svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor">
								<path d="m12.87 15.07-2.54-2.51.03-.03A17.52 17.52 0 0 0 14.07 6H17V4h-7V2H8v2H1v2h11.17C11.5 7.92 10.44 9.75 9 11.35 8.07 10.32 7.3 9.19 6.69 8h-2c.73 1.63 1.73 3.17 2.98 4.56l-5.09 5.02L4 19l5-5 3.11 3.11.76-2.04zM18.5 10h-2L12 22h2l1.12-3h4.75L21 22h2l-4.5-12zm-2.62 7 1.62-4.33L19.12 17h-3.24z"/>
							</svg>
							<span class="lang-zh font-bold">English</span>
							<span class="lang-en font-bold">中文</span>
						</a>
					</div>
				</div>

				<h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-black tracking-tight text-white mb-2 font-sans">
					<span class="lang-zh">一个黑点，炸开混沌</span>
					<span class="lang-en">ONE BLACK CELL</span>
				</h1>

				<p class="text-lg sm:text-xl font-bold text-amber-400 mb-4 tracking-wide font-mono">
					<span class="lang-zh">256 种初等元胞自动机实验室：从 8 位极简真值表到不可预测的图灵宇宙</span>
					<span class="lang-en">The 256 Elementary Cellular Automata Lab: From an 8-bit lookup table to universal computation</span>
				</p>

				<div class="space-y-3 max-w-4xl text-slate-300 leading-relaxed text-sm sm:text-base">
					<p>
						<span class="lang-zh">
							<strong>2026 年 10 月 23 日</strong>，Hacker News 首页热门长帖<strong>《Rule 30: one black cell》</strong>引发了全球开发者与复杂系统研究者的全天热议。讨论的核心魅力在于一个令人震惊的认知反差：<strong>一个居中的黑色像素点，加上一行仅有 8 个输出位的极简规则表，就能在几百步演化后自发炸出如同自然界纺锤织锦螺贝壳一般的无尽混沌</strong>。
						</span>
						<span class="lang-en">
							On <strong>23 October 2026</strong>, the Hacker News front-page post <strong>"Rule 30: one black cell"</strong> sparked a day-long worldwide discussion. The visceral hook: <strong>a solitary centered black cell and an eight-row lookup table can spontaneously generate an entire universe of intricate, seashell-like deterministic chaos</strong>.
						</span>
					</p>
					<p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-400">
						<span class="lang-zh">
							本页面并非该演示的简单翻版，而是一个覆盖全部 <strong>256 种初等元胞自动机（Elementary Cellular Automata, ECA）</strong>的完整交互式沙盒。每一个元胞的新状态严格仅取决于它自身与左右相邻的两个邻居（3 个元胞，2³ = 8 种邻域组合）。指定这 8 种组合的黑白输出，便定义了 2⁸ = 256 种独立规则。相同的黑点，换上一张不同的 8 位表，就能在画布上分别走出完美分形、真实交通拥堵激波，乃至能够模拟任意计算机程序的图灵完备世界。<strong>输出的复杂性，永远无法预先通过规则的简陋程度来度量。</strong>
						</span>
						<span class="lang-en">
							This page is our own comprehensive playground for all <strong>256 elementary cellular automata (ECA)</strong>. Each cell's state at the next timestep depends strictly on itself and its two immediate neighbours (3 cells, 2³ = 8 possible local neighbourhoods). Assigning a black or white output to each neighbourhood yields 2⁸ = 256 unique rules. The exact same single black seed, paired with a slightly altered 8-bit lookup table, yields pure self-similar fractals, motorway traffic jams, or a universal Turing-complete computer. <strong>The complexity of the output tells you nothing about the complexity of the rule.</strong>
						</span>
					</p>
				</div>
			</header>

			<!-- SECTION 1: THE UNIVERSE CANVAS -->
			<section class="relative z-10 mb-12">
				<div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3 mb-4">
					<div class="flex items-center gap-2">
						<span class="text-amber-400 font-mono text-xl font-bold">01/</span>
						<h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-white tracking-tight">
							<span class="lang-zh">时空织锦画布 · THE UNIVERSE CANVAS</span>
							<span class="lang-en">THE UNIVERSE CANVAS · Spacetime Weaver</span>
						</h2>
					</div>
					<div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 text-xs font-mono">
						<span class="text-slate-400">
							<span class="lang-zh">经典预设速选:</span>
							<span class="lang-en">Presets:</span>
						</span>
						<div class="flex flex-wrap gap-1.5" id="preset-chips">
							<button type="button" data-rule="30" class="preset-btn active px-2.5 py-1 rounded bg-amber-500/20 text-amber-300 border border-amber-500/50 hover:bg-amber-500/30 transition cursor-pointer active:scale-95">
								<span class="font-bold">30</span> <span class="text-[11px] opacity-80"><span class="lang-zh">混沌</span><span class="lang-en">Chaos</span></span>
							</button>
							<button type="button" data-rule="90" class="preset-btn px-2.5 py-1 rounded bg-slate-900 text-slate-300 border border-slate-700 hover:border-cyan-500 hover:text-cyan-300 transition cursor-pointer active:scale-95">
								<span class="font-bold">90</span> <span class="text-[11px] opacity-80"><span class="lang-zh">分形</span><span class="lang-en">Fractal</span></span>
							</button>
							<button type="button" data-rule="110" class="preset-btn px-2.5 py-1 rounded bg-slate-900 text-slate-300 border border-slate-700 hover:border-purple-500 hover:text-purple-300 transition cursor-pointer active:scale-95">
								<span class="font-bold">110</span> <span class="text-[11px] opacity-80"><span class="lang-zh">图灵完备</span><span class="lang-en">Universal</span></span>
							</button>
							<button type="button" data-rule="184" class="preset-btn px-2.5 py-1 rounded bg-slate-900 text-slate-300 border border-slate-700 hover:border-emerald-500 hover:text-emerald-300 transition cursor-pointer active:scale-95">
								<span class="font-bold">184</span> <span class="text-[11px] opacity-80"><span class="lang-zh">车流</span><span class="lang-en">Traffic</span></span>
							</button>
							<button type="button" data-rule="232" class="preset-btn px-2.5 py-1 rounded bg-slate-900 text-slate-300 border border-slate-700 hover:border-blue-500 hover:text-blue-300 transition cursor-pointer active:scale-95">
								<span class="font-bold">232</span> <span class="text-[11px] opacity-80"><span class="lang-zh">多数决</span><span class="lang-en">Majority</span></span>
							</button>
							<button type="button" data-rule="54" class="preset-btn px-2.5 py-1 rounded bg-slate-900 text-slate-300 border border-slate-700 hover:border-rose-500 hover:text-rose-300 transition cursor-pointer active:scale-95">
								<span class="font-bold">54</span> <span class="text-[11px] opacity-80"><span class="lang-zh">孤子</span><span class="lang-en">Solitons</span></span>
							</button>
							<button type="button" data-rule="150" class="preset-btn px-2.5 py-1 rounded bg-slate-900 text-slate-300 border border-slate-700 hover:border-indigo-500 hover:text-indigo-300 transition cursor-pointer active:scale-95">
								<span class="font-bold">150</span> <span class="text-[11px] opacity-80"><span class="lang-zh">波纹</span><span class="lang-en">Waves</span></span>
							</button>
							<button type="button" data-rule="60" class="preset-btn px-2.5 py-1 rounded bg-slate-900 text-slate-300 border border-slate-700 hover:border-teal-500 hover:text-teal-300 transition cursor-pointer active:scale-95">
								<span class="font-bold">60</span> <span class="text-[11px] opacity-80"><span class="lang-zh">单侧分形</span><span class="lang-en">Cascade</span></span>
							</button>
						</div>
					</div>
				</div>

				<!-- REAL-TIME METRICS STATUS BAR -->
				<div class="grid grid-cols-2 sm:grid-cols-4 lg:grid-cols-6 gap-2.5 mb-4 text-xs font-mono">
					<div class="p-3 rounded-xl bg-slate-900/90 border border-amber-500/30 shadow-inner">
						<div class="text-amber-400 font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-[11px]">
							<span class="lang-zh">当前规则</span>
							<span class="lang-en">ACTIVE RULE</span>
						</div>
						<div class="flex items-baseline gap-1 mt-0.5">
							<span id="metric-rule-num" class="text-2xl font-black text-white">30</span>
							<span class="text-slate-400 text-[11px]">/ 255</span>
						</div>
						<div id="metric-rule-bin" class="text-[11px] text-amber-300 font-mono">00011110₂</div>
					</div>

					<div class="p-3 rounded-xl bg-slate-900/90 border border-slate-800">
						<div class="text-slate-400 font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-[11px]">
							<span class="lang-zh">沃尔夫勒姆分类</span>
							<span class="lang-en">WOLFRAM CLASS</span>
						</div>
						<div id="metric-class-name" class="text-base font-black text-rose-400 mt-1">Class 3 · 混沌</div>
						<div id="metric-class-desc" class="text-[11px] text-slate-400 truncate">非周期不可约混沌</div>
					</div>

					<div class="p-3 rounded-xl bg-slate-900/90 border border-slate-800">
						<div class="text-slate-400 font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-[11px]">
							<span class="lang-zh">已演化世代</span>
							<span class="lang-en">GENERATIONS</span>
						</div>
						<div id="metric-step-count" class="text-2xl font-black text-cyan-300 mt-0.5">180</div>
						<div class="text-[11px] text-slate-400">时间沿垂直轴向下</div>
					</div>

					<div class="p-3 rounded-xl bg-slate-900/90 border border-slate-800">
						<div class="text-slate-400 font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-[11px]">
							<span class="lang-zh">黑胞存活密度</span>
							<span class="lang-en">ACTIVE DENSITY</span>
						</div>
						<div id="metric-density" class="text-2xl font-black text-emerald-300 mt-0.5">49.8%</div>
						<div id="metric-alive-count" class="text-[11px] text-slate-400">17,942 / 36,000</div>
					</div>

					<div class="p-3 rounded-xl bg-slate-900/90 border border-slate-800">
						<div class="text-slate-400 font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-[11px]">
							<span class="lang-zh">网格空间宽度</span>
							<span class="lang-en">GRID WIDTH</span>
						</div>
						<div id="metric-grid-dim" class="text-2xl font-black text-purple-300 mt-0.5">401 胞</div>
						<div class="text-[11px] text-slate-400">周期性环面边界</div>
					</div>

					<div class="p-3 rounded-xl bg-slate-900/90 border border-slate-800">
						<div class="text-slate-400 font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-[11px]">
							<span class="lang-zh">运行帧率 / 状态</span>
							<span class="lang-en">ENGINE STATUS</span>
						</div>
						<div id="metric-fps" class="text-2xl font-black text-amber-300 mt-0.5">60 FPS</div>
						<div id="metric-engine-state" class="text-[11px] text-emerald-400">● 持续推进中</div>
					</div>
				</div>

				<!-- MAIN INTERACTIVE CANVAS WRAPPER -->
				<div class="relative rounded-2xl overflow-hidden border border-slate-700 bg-[#030611] shadow-2xl group">
					<div class="relative w-full overflow-x-auto overflow-y-hidden flex justify-center bg-black/40 min-h-[380px] sm:min-h-[460px]">
						<canvas id="universe-canvas" class="max-w-full block shadow-2xl transition duration-150 cursor-crosshair"></canvas>
					</div>

					<!-- Hover Cell Inspector Bar -->
					<div id="canvas-inspector" class="absolute bottom-3 left-3 right-3 sm:right-auto px-3 py-1.5 rounded-lg bg-slate-950/90 border border-slate-700 text-xs font-mono text-slate-300 backdrop-blur-md flex items-center justify-between gap-4 pointer-events-none opacity-90 transition">
						<div class="flex items-center gap-2">
							<span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-amber-400"></span>
							<span><span class="lang-zh">坐标</span><span class="lang-en">Coord</span>: (<span id="insp-x">0</span>, t=<span id="insp-t">0</span>)</span>
						</div>
						<div>
							<span><span class="lang-zh">状态</span><span class="lang-en">State</span>: <span id="insp-val" class="font-bold text-amber-300">1 (黑胞)</span></span>
						</div>
						<div class="hidden sm:block">
							<span><span class="lang-zh">前驱邻域</span><span class="lang-en">Parent</span>: <span id="insp-neigh" class="font-bold text-cyan-300">100</span></span>
						</div>
					</div>

					<!-- Watermark/Hint -->
					<div class="absolute top-3 right-3 px-2.5 py-1 rounded bg-black/60 border border-white/10 text-[11px] font-mono text-slate-400 backdrop-blur-sm pointer-events-none">
						<span class="lang-zh">时间轴 ↓ 向下演化</span>
						<span class="lang-en">Time Flow ↓ Downward</span>
					</div>
				</div>

				<!-- CANVAS CONTROLS TOOLBAR -->
				<div class="mt-4 p-4 rounded-xl bg-slate-900/80 border border-slate-800 space-y-4">
					<div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3">
						<!-- Play / Step / Reset controls -->
						<div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2">
							<button id="btn-play-pause" type="button" class="px-4 py-2 rounded-lg bg-amber-500 text-slate-950 font-bold font-mono text-xs sm:text-sm hover:bg-amber-400 transition cursor-pointer active:scale-95 flex items-center gap-1.5 shadow-lg shadow-amber-500/20">
								<span id="play-icon">⏸</span>
								<span id="play-text" class="lang-zh">暂停推进</span>
								<span id="play-text-en" class="lang-en">Pause</span>
							</button>
							<button id="btn-step" type="button" class="px-3.5 py-2 rounded-lg bg-slate-800 border border-slate-700 text-slate-200 font-mono text-xs sm:text-sm hover:bg-slate-700 hover:text-white transition cursor-pointer active:scale-95" title="Advance 1 Generation">
								<span>⏭ +1 <span class="lang-zh">步</span><span class="lang-en">step</span></span>
							</button>
							<button id="btn-step-10" type="button" class="px-3 py-2 rounded-lg bg-slate-800 border border-slate-700 text-slate-200 font-mono text-xs sm:text-sm hover:bg-slate-700 hover:text-white transition cursor-pointer active:scale-95" title="Advance 10 Generations">
								<span>+10 <span class="lang-zh">步</span><span class="lang-en">steps</span></span>
							</button>
							<button id="btn-restart" type="button" class="px-3.5 py-2 rounded-lg bg-slate-800 border border-slate-700 text-slate-200 font-mono text-xs sm:text-sm hover:bg-slate-700 hover:text-white transition cursor-pointer active:scale-95" title="Restart simulation from Row 0">
								<span>↺ <span class="lang-zh">重启演化</span><span class="lang-en">Restart</span></span>
							</button>
						</div>

						<!-- Theme & Download controls -->
						<div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 font-mono text-xs">
							<span class="text-slate-400">
								<span class="lang-zh">配色主题:</span>
								<span class="lang-en">Theme:</span>
							</span>
							<div class="flex items-center gap-1 bg-slate-950 p-1 rounded-lg border border-slate-800">
								<button type="button" data-theme="ember" class="theme-btn active px-2.5 py-1 rounded text-amber-300 bg-amber-950/60 border border-amber-600/40 transition">
									<span class="lang-zh">琥珀烈焰</span>
									<span class="lang-en">Ember</span>
								</button>
								<button type="button" data-theme="neon" class="theme-btn px-2.5 py-1 rounded text-slate-400 hover:text-cyan-300 transition">
									<span class="lang-zh">霓虹深蓝</span>
									<span class="lang-en">Neon</span>
								</button>
								<button type="button" data-theme="ink" class="theme-btn px-2.5 py-1 rounded text-slate-400 hover:text-white transition">
									<span class="lang-zh">纸墨古籍</span>
									<span class="lang-en">Ink</span>
								</button>
							</div>

							<button id="btn-download" type="button" class="px-3 py-1.5 rounded-lg bg-slate-800 border border-slate-700 text-slate-200 hover:text-amber-300 hover:border-amber-500/50 transition cursor-pointer active:scale-95 flex items-center gap-1.5">
								<span>💾</span>
								<span class="lang-zh">下载高清 PNG</span>
								<span class="lang-en">Export PNG</span>
							</button>
						</div>
					</div>

					<!-- Sliders Row: Rule Slider, Speed, Generations, Cell Size -->
					<div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-4 gap-4 pt-3 border-t border-slate-800 text-xs font-mono">
						<!-- Rule 0-255 Slider + linked number input -->
						<div class="space-y-1.5">
							<div class="flex items-center justify-between">
								<span class="text-slate-300 font-semibold">
									<span class="lang-zh">规则编号 (Rule 0–255)</span>
									<span class="lang-en">Rule Slider (0–255)</span>
								</span>
								<div class="flex items-center gap-1">
									<input id="input-rule-num" type="number" min="0" max="255" value="30" class="w-16 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded bg-slate-950 border border-amber-500/50 text-amber-300 text-right font-bold focus:outline-none focus:ring-1 focus:ring-amber-400" />
								</div>
							</div>
							<input id="slider-rule-num" type="range" min="0" max="255" value="30" class="w-full accent-amber-500 cursor-pointer" />
						</div>

						<!-- Speed Slider -->
						<div class="space-y-1.5">
							<div class="flex items-center justify-between">
								<span class="text-slate-300 font-semibold">
									<span class="lang-zh">演化步进速度</span>
									<span class="lang-en">Simulation Speed</span>
								</span>
								<span id="speed-label" class="text-amber-300">1.0×</span>
							</div>
							<input id="slider-speed" type="range" min="1" max="60" value="30" class="w-full accent-amber-500 cursor-pointer" />
						</div>

						<!-- Generations (Height) Slider -->
						<div class="space-y-1.5">
							<div class="flex items-center justify-between">
								<span class="text-slate-300 font-semibold">
